<body>
    <h1>Logic+</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Logic+ is a robust workflow tool designed to streamline customer=
 interactions, elevate agent productivity, and optimize call flow managemen=
t. This powerful platform enables organizations to build, customize, and ma=
nage dynamic call flows that seamlessly integrate with existing systems, su=
pporting a wide range of operational needs. Through its flexible framework,=
 Logic+ empowers businesses to create complex, responsive workflows that al=
ign with specific organizational objectives, ensuring customer inquiries ar=
e addressed with precision, efficiency, and speed.</p>
<p>Logic+ comes with a wide range of panels that serve specific purposes, i=
ncluding the following:</p>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #C0B6F2;border-width: 1px;"=
>
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #C0B6F2;">
<p><strong>Click on any of the links below to access specific Logic+ panel =
articles:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4246470=
680/Building+Logic" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4246470680" data-linked-reso=
urce-version=3D"7" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Building Logi=
c+</strong></a></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Data</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4248436=
737/Set+Variable" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4248436737" data-linked-resour=
ce-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Set Variable</s=
trong></a><strong>:</strong> Updates a specified interaction variable with =
a new value, allowing for dynamic decisions and tracking within the interac=
tion.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4245159=
937/Integration" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4245159937" data-linked-resourc=
e-version=3D"8" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Integration</str=
ong></a><strong>:</strong> Connects to third-party systems directly within =
the Logic+ flow to expand functionality.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4244602=
881/SharpenDB+SELECT" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4244602881" data-linked-re=
source-version=3D"4" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>SharpenDB S=
ELECT</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Executes a SELECT on custom tables and=
 data in SharpenDB, supporting personalized customer experiences and dynami=
c routing decisions.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4244930=
561/SharpenDB+DELETE" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4244930561" data-linked-re=
source-version=3D"3" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>SharpenDB D=
ELETE</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Executes a DELETE on custom tables and=
 data in SharpenDB.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4244602=
905/SharpenDB+UPDATE" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4244602905" data-linked-re=
source-version=3D"3" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>SharpenDB U=
PDATE</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Executes an UPDATE on custom tables an=
d data in SharpenDB.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4244602=
966/SharpenDB+INSERT" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4244602966" data-linked-re=
source-version=3D"3" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>SharpenDB I=
NSERT</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Executes an INSERT on custom tables an=
d data in SharpenDB.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4249714=
689/Port+X" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4249714689" data-linked-resource-ver=
sion=3D"3" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>PortX</strong></a>: S=
implifies integrating your Sharpen contact center or IVR with any banking c=
ore.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Action</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4243226=
636/Condition" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4243226636" data-linked-resource-=
version=3D"3" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Condition</strong>=
</a><strong>:</strong> Evaluates a condition to support decision-making in =
Logic+ flows.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3423698=
949/Switch" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3423698949" data-linked-resource-ver=
sion=3D"13" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Switch</strong></a><=
strong>:</strong> Evaluates an interaction variable to enable branching pat=
hs or actions based on the comparison result.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3424550=
925/Send+SMS" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3424550925" data-linked-resource-v=
ersion=3D"18" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Send SMS</strong><=
/a><strong>:</strong> Sends text messages to recipients based on configured=
 settings.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3424452=
641/Send+Email" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3424452641" data-linked-resource=
-version=3D"10" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Send Email</stro=
ng></a><strong>:</strong> Dispatches emails based on configured settings wi=
thin the Logic+ flow.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3424845=
827/Transfer+To+Classic+Logic" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3424845827" data-=
linked-resource-version=3D"7" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Tr=
ansfer to Classic Logic</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Facilitates outbound=
 calls using Classic Logic functionality.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4236312=
615/Time+Control" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4236312615" data-linked-resour=
ce-version=3D"4" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Time Control</s=
trong></a><strong>:</strong> Implements time-based controls within the Logi=
c+ flow.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4236312=
577/Logic+Subroutine" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4236312577" data-linked-re=
source-version=3D"5" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Logic+ Subr=
outine</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Executes a defined subroutine within =
the Logic+ flow to streamline processes.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Queue</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3425075=
209/Transfer+To+Queue" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3425075209" data-linked-r=
esource-version=3D"10" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Transfer =
to Queue</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Directs the caller to a specified q=
ueue for further assistance.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3424616=
460/Notify+Agent+In+Queue" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3424616460" data-link=
ed-resource-version=3D"6" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Notify=
 Agent in Queue</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Sends an in-app notification=
 to an agent currently logged into a queue.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4467294=
230/Agent+Assist" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4467294230" data-linked-resour=
ce-version=3D"3" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Agent Assist</s=
trong></a><strong>: </strong>Displays data from previous panels within the =
Sharpen UI, ensuring seamless information flow and improved agent visibilit=
y.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Inbound Voice</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3425042=
439/Play+Message" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3425042439" data-linked-resour=
ce-version=3D"18" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Play Message</=
strong></a><strong>:</strong> Plays audio prompts and captures DTMF inputs =
for use in routing or decision-making.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4243914=
753/Convert+to+Voice" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4243914753" data-linked-re=
source-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Convert To =
Voice</strong></a>: The panel initiates a call to a provided customer numbe=
r.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3424714=
774/Transfer+To+External" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3424714774" data-linke=
d-resource-version=3D"6" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Transfe=
r To External</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Redirects the caller to an ext=
ernal phone number.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3424550=
932/Disconnect" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3424550932" data-linked-resource=
-version=3D"8" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Disconnect</stron=
g></a><strong>:</strong> Ends a call interaction.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Bots</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3424550=
939/Bot+-+Customer360" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3424550939" data-linked-r=
esource-version=3D"13" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Bot - Cus=
tomer360</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Reviews a customer's inbound queue =
activity on the Sharpen platform for enhanced customer insight.</p></li>
<li>
<p><a href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/4246470=
658/Logic+Sidekicks" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4246470658" data-linked-res=
ource-version=3D"2" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page"><strong>Sidekicks</s=
trong></a></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<h4 id=3D"Logic+-Summary">Summary</h4>
<p>Each panel serves a unique purpose, allowing businesses to tailor their =
workflows to their specific needs. By utilizing Logic+, businesses can impr=
ove customer satisfaction, reduce wait times, and optimize their overall cu=
stomer service experience.</p>
    </div>
</body>
